    "profile": {
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "HTML",
          "html": "Edward \"Tito\" Odumbe is the elder brother of Kenyan captain  Maurice Odumbe, and was undoubtedly latterly in the Kenyan side for his international experience.  A superb allrounder in  his heyday, he did  not  get  many wickets against India A, yet was able to make use of his experience by adopting a nagging line and  length  and hence, did not give too many runs away.  His ability to effectively slog in the latter overs added to  his  importance.  Off the field, he is an extremely\nhumorous person, always looking to play pranks in the locker-room.\n<BR><B>Dipesh Patel</B>"
        }
      ]
    },
